        </div>
        <div class="contact-actions">
            <a class="button button-light" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/saikrishna-vempati" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message me on LinkedIn <span>→</span></a>
            <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/saikrishna844" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/saikrishna844 ↗</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="https://saikrishnavempati.hashnode.dev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read my technical blog ↗</a>
        </div>
